<< /A << /BBox [ 128.863 256.252 466.016 761.443 ] /O /Layout >> /Alt (Infographic outlining recommended force plate tests and metrics for pre-military course selection, featuring three sections: Isometric Mid-Thigh Pull \(IMTP\), Countermovement Jump \(CMJ\), and Drop Jump. Each section lists outcome-based and strategy-based metrics, such as peak force, jump height, force at specific time points, braking and propulsive phase durations, ground contact time, and relative force measures. Illustrations show individuals performing each test using standardized equipment, such as a force plate or barbell. Additional notes clarify reporting requirements for forces, net force, and component metric calculation for RSI and drop height.) /K 5 /Lang (en-EN) /P 21 0 R /Pg 230 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
endobj
